WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers,

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.636
and this is "Late Night."
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.739
[ Cheers and applause ]
Great to hear.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.673
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:09.843
According to a new report,
top Democrats

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.877
are starting to worry
that President Biden

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:14.313
will run for re-election
in 2024,

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.783
specifically this top Democrat.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.586
[ As Biden ] "Oh, do I have to?"

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:22.188
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.023
After the house committee
investigating

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.659
the Capitol attack
showed video testimony last week

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.295
of Ivanka Trump saying
that she did not believe

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.464
her father's claims
of election fraud,

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.299
former President Trump
said that she,

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.567
"Checked out of
election results."

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:38.972
Though to be fair, that's just
what people used to do

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:40.807
after an election was over.

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.408
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.411
The house committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:46.178
today held
its second public hearing.

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:48.614
They weren't going to,
but then Rudy Giuliani said,

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:51.150
"Make it a double."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.153
Fox News today also aired
coverage

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:56.790
of the House January 6th
committee's second hearing.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.592
Said Fox News viewers,
"Bam, I'm on TV!"

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.694
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.796
"Remember that thing?"

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:08.201
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:11.704
Police in Idaho on Saturday
arrested 31 members

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.173
of the white supremacist group
Patriot Front

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:17.109
after they were discovered
inside of a U-Haul truck

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:19.011
near an LGBTQ Pride event.

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:21.013
And based on the photo,
I assume

00:01:21.013 --> 00:01:23.816
Patriot Front is
a style of khakis?

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.584
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:27.320
You got flat front,
pleated front,

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.488
and Patriot Front.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:31.858
And, uh, those
only come in extra small.

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:33.193
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.628
Oh, you thought they were
packed into that U-Haul.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:38.998
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:41.834
The Labor Department
announced on Friday

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:44.537
that inflation has hit
a new 40-year high.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.773
You will now pay the same amount

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.540
for a banana
at the grocery store

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.811
as you used to pay for a banana
at an airport Starbucks.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.579
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.682
"Forbes" magazine
announced last week

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:58.150
that golfer Tiger Woods is
officially a billionaire,

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.652
leaving him no choice
but to start a company

00:02:00.652 --> 00:02:02.322
to launch him into space.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.490
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.492
The Tony awards
were held last night,

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:09.428
and "A Strange Loop"
won Best Musical.

00:02:09.428 --> 00:02:12.999
It's the musical adaptation
of my penis.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.602
No!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:18.671
I'm not doing that joke.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:27.613
And finally, Ikea in Norway
has launched

00:02:27.613 --> 00:02:30.817
an online baby-name generator
based on its product line.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:33.119
They just figured you should
have something from Ikea

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:34.787
that lasts more than a year.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.257
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

